## 2. Scope & Assumptions  

| Item | Details |
|------|---------|
| **Target code** | • `app/excel_tools.py` <br>• `app/workbook_manager.py` <br>• `app/routes.py` <br>• `app/db.py` <br>• `app/llm_client.py` <br>• `app/formula_engine.py` |
| **Runtime** | Python 3.11, FastAPI 0.115+, uvicorn 0.31+ |
| **Execution model** | Single‑process ASGI server serving all users concurrently (no explicit user isolation). |
| **Missing code** | – Full body of `WorkbookManager.apply_formula` was truncated. <br>– Tests and CLI scripts were not part of the source snapshot. |
| **External services** | OpenAI/Ollama LLM, SQLite file on disk. |
| **Assumptions** | • The code compiles as‑is with the listed `requirements.txt`. <br>• No external authentication mechanisms are in place. <br>• The repository follows the directory structure shown in the code‑review stand‑up. |

