## 5. Verification & Testing Checklist  

| Test | Goal | Expected Result | Tool/Method |
|------|------|-----------------|-------------|
| **Concurrent Session Test** | Ensure per‑session isolation | Two clients controlling independent workbooks; no cross‑corruption | Custom test harness using `httpx.AsyncClient` |
| **Auth Enforcement** | Verify protected endpoints reject unauthenticated access | 401 Unauthorized | curl or Postman |
| **Upload Size Enforcement** | Confirm 413 response for oversized file | 413 Payload Too Large | Post with large multipart file |
| **Destructive Range Guard** | Verify operation limit triggers error | JSON with success:false and message about size | API call with large range |
| **Download Path Validation** | Ensure path cannot escape `workbooks/` | 403 Forbidden when path outside root | Manipulate session path via spoofed request |
| **Error Masking** | No stack trace in client response | Generic error message | Trigger known LLM error (bad cell reference) |
| **SQLite Concurrency** | No lock timeouts under load | No 5xx during burst | Load‑test tool (Locust) |
| **XML Bomb** | Server resists XML expansion | Accepts safe file; rejects malicious | Create XML bomb workbook, upload |
| **Undo Snapshot Limits** | No memory blow‑up | Memory <10 Mb under 3 concurrent edits of 1 Mb workbook | psutil memory snapshot |
| **LLM Key Exposure** | Key not printed to logs | Log lines show masked key | Inspect log files |
| **`apply_formula` Functionality** | Formula evaluated correctly | Cell shows computed value | API call to apply formula |

